<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n256" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθο-ποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do good,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Marc.
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινά</span>”
				<i>do good to,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ev.Luc.
					6.33
				</span></i>
			: c. dupl. acc., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				10.32
			</span></i>, Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				242
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ma.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>make good,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.7.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
					9.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>make favourable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				203.32
			</span></i>: 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.Laod.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				5(1).185
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>exert beneficent influence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Par.Ptol.</u>
				292
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>do well, act rightly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>.</div>
